.TH WB\-REVISION 1 "" "watchbill"
.SH NAME
wb\-revision \- print the version, the revision and its manifest
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
\fBwb\fR revision
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Print the version of the package, the hash of its revision and the manifest: the hash of every file the revision holds. Writes nothing.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
It is printed.
.TP
.B 1
The manifest could not be made.
.TP
.B 2
It was given a word: it takes none.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR wb (1) ,
.BR wb\-check (1) ,
.BR wb\-upgrade (1)
